; Plays the note of a letter on voice 1. Input: A = screen code ($80 + letter index). The frequency comes from the tables $2fe0 (low) and $2fc0 (high). X does not change.
letter_note
        sec
        sbc #$80
        sta bomb_row
        txa
        pha
        ldx bomb_row
        lda letter_pitch_lo,x
        sta FRELO1
        lda letter_pitch_hi,x
        sta FREHI1
        lda #$21
        sta VCREG1
        pla
        tax
        rts
